      "content": "wait really? my grandma always used to put butter on burns to soothe them and she said it works like a charm. i dont really want to go to the doctor or an ER if i dont have to, its kind of a hassle and expensive. if i just use a thick layer of the butter or maybe some coconut oil, can't that just help it heal faster? it's just a small blistered area, surely it's not that serious?",
