      "content": "i hear you but im just really nervous about going to a hospital. if i just keep it clean and maybe apply some aloe vera or even just heavy antibiotic ointment once it cools down, would that be okay? i feel like i can handle managing this myself if i just stay on top of the cleaning. is it really worth a whole doctor's visit for just a few blisters?",
